      "id": "claim_233d340a891b47949422583bb923dc9b",
      "statement": "Tables are defined as TABLES = { rooftop: R1-R5, downstairs: D1-D2 } with deliberate zone prefixes so table numbers never collide across floors; after the customer picks a table the URL gains ?t=<table> via history.replaceState so refreshes keep context, and stray ?t= params from old bookmarked per-table links are tolerated rather than trusted.",
